/E (Adoption of low-codedevelopment isnot uniform across sectors. Financial services organizations have emerged as leading adopters, driven largely by the need to automate regulatory compliance processes and rapidly deliver customer-facing digital banking features. Healthcare organizations are leveraging low-code to build patient engagement portals and internal workflow tools while navigating strict data privacy requirements. Government agencies increasingly use low-code and no-code platforms to modernize citizen-facing services without the multi-year timelines traditionally associated with public-sector IT )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
