/P 80 0 R
/E (Organizations that combine these practices with a genuine cultural shift toward distributed, business-led development, supported rather than obstructed by IT, are best positioned to realize the full productivity benefits of low-code platforms while containing the associated risks. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (Low-code application development has decisively transitioned from a tactical shortcut for departmental tools into a strategic pillar of enterprise software delivery. The convergence of visual, model-driven development with generative and agentic artificial intelligence is accelerating this shift further, enabling faster, more accessible application creation across both professional and citizen-developer communities. However, this rapid growth brings genuine challenges around governance, security, integration complexity, and vendor sustainability that organizations must address deliberately rather than as an afterthought. As the technology continues to mature through 2026 and beyond, low-code development is poised to remain one of the most consequential trends reshaping how software is built, by whom, and how quickly it can respond to business )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
