/Title (Financial services, healthcare, and government sectors are frequently cited as leading adopters, driven respectively by regulatory compliance automation, patient-facing digital services, and citizen-service modernization initiatives. The consistent theme across research sources is a compound annual growth rate in the low-to-mid twenty-percent range, positioning low-code as one of the fastest-expanding segments of enterprise software.)
